ests Num 4:19 ; Num 4:49 ; Num 8:11 ; 1Chr 24:3 ; 1Chr 24:19 ; 2Chr 8:14 ; 2Chr 31:16 מתנה ׳ ע Num 18:7 Levites Exod 38:21 ; Num 4:24 ; Num 4:27 (twice in verse); Num 4:28 ; Num 4:33 ; Num 4:47 (twice in verse); Num 7:7 ; Num 7:8 ; Num 8:26 ; Num 18:21 ; 1Chr 6:17 ; 2Chr 31:2 with בְּאֹהֶל מוֺעֵד v 2Chr 31:4 v 2Chr 31:23 v 2Chr 31:31 v 2Chr 31:33 v 2Chr 31:35 v 2Chr 31:39 v 2Chr 31:43 ; 2Chr 8:19 ; 2Chr 8:22 ; 2Chr 18:31 אֹהֶל מוֺעֵד Exod 30:16 ; Num 4:30 ; Num 7:5 ; Num 8:24 ; Num 18:4 ; Num 18:6 ; Num 18:21 ; Num 18:23 , compare Exod 35:21 ; Num 7:5 (ה)מִשְׁכָּן Exod 39:32 ; Exod 39:40 ; Num 3:7 ; Num 3:8 ; Num 16:9 ; 1Chr 6:33 , compare Exod 27:19 ; Num 3:36 ; 1Chr 23:26 הַקֹּדֶשׁ ׳ ע Num 7:9 , compare Num 3:31 of its court v Num 3:26 more specifically משׂא ׳ ע Num 4:47 ׳ צבא הע Num 8:25 (ה)אלהים ׳ בית י ׳ ע 1Chr 23:24 ; 1Chr 23:28 ; 1Chr 23:32 ; 1Chr 25:6 ; 1Chr 28:13 (twice in verse); 1Chr 28:21 (twice in verse); 1Chr 29:7 ; 2Chr 29:35 ; 2Chr 31:21 ; 2Chr 35:2 ; Neh 10:33 בית האלהים ׳ מלאכת ע 1Chr 9:13 ; 1Chr 28:20 ; 2Chr 24:12 ׳ מעשׂה ע 1Chr 23:28 its service Ezek 44:14 ; 1Chr 9:19 specific service of Levitical singers 1Chr 25:1 (twice in verse), and doorkeepers 1Chr 26:8 ; 2Chr 35:15 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5744')\">BDB5744</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5656')\">H5656</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5743')\">BDB5743</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5745')\">BDB5745</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עַבֹדָה</bdbheb>, and (Chronicles) <bdbheb>עֲבוֺדָה</bdbheb><sub>145</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>labour, service</highlightword> (on formation see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 179</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 61</sup></lookup>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 1:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,14)\">Exod 1:14</ref> + 41 t.; construct <bdbheb>עֲבֹדַת</bdbheb> 